"use strict";(globalThis.webpackChunk_8x8_developer_docs=globalThis.webpackChunk_8x8_developer_docs||[]).push([[76084],{81819:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"id":"2026-10-20-converse-reporting-api-filters","date":"2026-10-20","products":["Converse"],"product":"Converse","channel":"","changeType":"Changed","title":"Converse Reporting API: queue and status filters, corrected field reference","excerpt":"Get conversations data can now be narrowed by queue and by conversation status, and the Reporting API reference has been corrected to match the API\'s actual behaviour.","hasArticle":true,"bodyHtml":"<p><strong>Get conversations data</strong> can now be narrowed by queue and by conversation status, and the Reporting API reference has been corrected to match the API&#39;s actual behaviour.</p>\\n<h2>New optional filters</h2>\\n<table>\\n<thead>\\n<tr>\\n<th>Property</th>\\n<th>Accepts</th>\\n</tr>\\n</thead>\\n<tbody><tr>\\n<td><code>queues</code></td>\\n<td>A queue UUID, or an array of up to 50. Matches the conversation&#39;s current queue.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><code>conversationStatus</code></td>\\n<td>A status, or an array of <code>initialized</code>, <code>open</code>, <code>assigned</code>, <code>read</code>, <code>responded</code>, <code>closed</code>.</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody></table>\\n<p>Send both to match conversations that satisfy both. Requests without them return the same report as before.</p>\\n<h2>Clarified behaviour</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>from</code> and <code>to</code> filter on the conversation&#39;s <strong>creation</strong> time, and the range must be within <strong>30 days</strong>.</li>\\n<li>Results are returned oldest first.</li>\\n<li>Errors are returned with HTTP 200 and <code>status: &quot;Failed&quot;</code>; the reference now lists each error message.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Corrected field reference</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Conversation <code>type</code> is <code>inbound</code> or <code>outbound_conversation</code>; <code>queue</code>, <code>agent</code> and <code>contact.key</code> are UUIDs.</li>\\n<li>Message records now document attachments, <code>conversationKey</code>, <code>hasAttachments</code> and the contact.</li>\\n<li>Agent <code>manager</code> and <code>supervisor</code> are booleans.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Read more</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\"/converse/reference/get-conversations-report\\">Get conversations data \u2014 API reference</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\"/converse/reference/get-chats-report\\">Get chats data \u2014 API reference</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\"/converse/reference/get-agents-report\\">Get agent data \u2014 API reference</a></li>\\n</ul>\\n"}')}}]);